\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Definition-level decisions name acceptance tests with exact domains and comparison targets. Tests progress through proposed, stated, and proved. A revised statement invalidates prior validation until its proof is rechecked. Foundation choices remain provisional until \ref{ms-foundation}; a false test requires revising the definition or the advertised claim, not adding an axiom.}
}
